*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : SLZ4040-180
* Inductance = 30nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 100kHz-3GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor Frequency Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt SLZ4040-180_freq port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=17.43pF Ind=0.03uH
X1 port1 port2 Model1A PARAMS:
+ R1=90.4
+ R2=0.00032
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.000289
+ K2=2.25
+ K3= {Ind}
+ K4=0.000602
+ K5=0.00000798
.ends SLZ4040-180_freq

